[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3909069068","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116361#issuecomment-3909069068","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116361","id":3909069068,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7o_6kM","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-16T15:24:45Z","updated_at":"2026-02-16T15:24:45Z","body":"Please explain what this is trying to achieve, what problems it solves, etc.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3909069068/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3909131640","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116361#issuecomment-3909131640","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116361","id":3909131640,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7pAJ14","user":{"login":"Konstantin-Kornienko2006","id":211348523,"node_id":"U_kgDODJjsKw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/211348523?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Konstantin-Kornienko2006","html_url":"https://github.com/Konstantin-Kornienko2006","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Konstantin-Kornienko2006/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Konstantin-Kornienko2006/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Konstantin-Kornienko2006/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Konstantin-Kornienko2006/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Konstantin-Kornienko2006/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Konstantin-Kornienko2006/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Konstantin-Kornienko2006/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Konstantin-Kornienko2006/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Konstantin-Kornienko2006/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-16T15:36:50Z","updated_at":"2026-02-16T15:37:29Z","body":"> Please explain what this is trying to achieve, what problems it solves, etc.\r\n\r\nto make name_hierarchy reflect the inheritance chain as Godot actually uses it (Object → Node → Sprite, etc.).\r\nSince Godot stores and checks classes through the ClassDB, and the order of names in the hierarchy directly affects methods like is_class() and inherits().\r\nRemove unnecessary copies and moves of StringName, and make the constructor simpler and more understandable","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3909131640/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3909141929","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116361#issuecomment-3909141929","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116361","id":3909141929,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7pAMWp","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-16T15:39:00Z","updated_at":"2026-02-16T15:45:29Z","body":"Please open an issue to track this, I don't know of any issue of that kind happening, and I don't see how this change solves that\r\n\r\nThe move is by design AFAIK, the constructor *should* take `StringName` not `const StringName &` to handle values correctly\r\n\r\nEdit: A PR should always follow a well defined and tracked issue, most of the time PRs should have either a proposal or a bug report related to it, unless there's some clear and obvious issue in the code itself (which there isn't in this case)","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3909141929/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4063324613","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116361#issuecomment-4063324613","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116361","id":4063324613,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7yMWnF","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-15T16:23:45Z","updated_at":"2026-03-15T16:23:45Z","body":"Thank you for your interest in cleaning up the codebase.\nThe StringName value propagation is indeed intended, it is more efficient than const ref passing and allows the caller to control creation vs copying.\n\nThe name hierarchy must stay in the order it is in now because it is expected in this order more often than the \"Object first\" order, e.g. see https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117442\nIf this order is causing issues, please file a bug report.\n\nIf you're interested in finding code to clean up, we have plenty of candidates throughout the engine, a lot of it tracked in issues. You can find ways to browse it described in our [contributing docs](https://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/introduction.html#what-can-i-contribute).","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4063324613/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]